#. TRANSLATORS: Command name
#: misc.py:32
msgid "info"
msgstr "info"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command description
#: misc.py:34
msgid "Give you information about the bot."
msgstr "Ik geef je wat informatie over de bot."

#: misc.py:44
msgid ""
"MarriageBot is a bot that allows users to marry, divorce, and have children "
"with other users. It also features a unique family tree system that allows "
"users to view their family history and relationships.\n"
"-# MarriageBot is being maintained by [Voxel Fox](https://voxelfox.co.uk)."
msgstr ""
"MarriageBot is een bot waarmee gebruikers kunnen trouwen, scheiden en "
"kinderen krijgen met andere gebruikers. De bot heeft ook een uniek "
"stamboomsysteem waarmee gebruikers hun familiegeschiedenis en relaties "
"kunnen bekijken.\n"
"-# MarriageBot wordt onderhouden door [Voxel Fox](https://voxelfox.co.uk)."

#: misc.py:52
msgid "Family Tree Members"
msgstr "Leden van de stamboom"

#: misc.py:62 misc.py:176
msgid "Donate"
msgstr "Doneer"

#: misc.py:67
msgid "Support Server"
msgstr "Ondersteuningsserver"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command name
#: misc.py:81
msgid "perks"
msgstr "extraatjes"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command description
#: misc.py:83
msgid "Give you information about the bot's premium perks."
msgstr "Ik geef je informatie over de premiumvoordelen van de bot."

#. TRANSLATORS: Command name
#: misc.py:94
msgid "donate"
msgstr "doneren"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command description
#: misc.py:96
msgid "Give you information about the bot's donation options."
msgstr "Ik geef je informatie over de donatiemogelijkheden van de bot."

#: misc.py:112
msgid "Support MarriageBot"
msgstr "Steun MarriageBot"

#: misc.py:114
msgid ""
"If you enjoy MarriageBot, please consider donating to support its ongoing "
"maintainance, development, and hosting costs.\n"
"MarriageBot isn't a small bot by any means, and keeping it going requires a "
"lot of time and resources behind the scenes."
msgstr ""
"Als je MarriageBot leuk vindt, overweeg dan om een donatie te doen om de "
"kosten voor het onderhoud, de ontwikkeling en de hosting te ondersteunen.\n"
"MarriageBot is zeker geen kleine bot, en om hem draaiende te houden zijn "
"achter de schermen veel tijd en middelen nodig."

#: misc.py:120
msgid "Donation Perks"
msgstr "Voordelen bij donaties"

#: misc.py:122
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"By supporting MarriageBot, you gain access to exclusive perks depending on "
"your subscription level:\n"
"* Default\n"
"  * 5 children\n"
"  * 1 partner\n"
"* T1\n"
"  * 10 children\n"
"  * 2 partners\n"
"  * Access to {disownall_c}\n"
"* T2\n"
"  * 15 children\n"
"  * 4 partners\n"
"  * Access to {disownall_c}\n"
"  * Access to {fulltree_c}\n"
"* T3\n"
"  * 20 children\n"
"  * 8 partners\n"
"  * Access to {disownall_c}\n"
"  * Access to {fulltree_c}\n"
"In addition, you can buy MarriageBot Gold for your server, which lets your "
"server have its own family tree, and gives you access to the force "
"commands!\n"
"* Default\n"
"  * Global tree\n"
"* Gold\n"
"  * Server-specific tree\n"
"  * Access to the force commands ({forcedivorce_c}, {forcemarry_c}, "
"{forceadopt_c}, {forcerunaway_c})\n"
"  * Access to {incest_c}\n"
"  * T3 perks for all of your server members\n"
msgstr ""
"Door MarriageBot te steunen, krijg je toegang tot exclusieve voordelen, "
"afhankelijk van je abonnementsniveau:\n"
"* Standaard\n"
"  * 5 kinderen\n"
"  * 1 partner\n"
"* T1\n"
"  * 10 kinderen\n"
"  * 2 partners\n"
"  * Toegang tot {disownall_c}\n"
"* T2\n"
"  * 15 kinderen\n"
"  * 4 partners\n"
"  * Toegang tot {disownall_c}\n"
"  * Toegang tot {fulltree_c}\n"
"* T3\n"
"  * 20 kinderen\n"
"  * 8 partners\n"
"  * Toegang tot {disownall_c}\n"
"  * Toegang tot {fulltree_c}\n"
"Daarnaast kun je MarriageBot Gold kopen voor je server, waardoor je server "
"een eigen stamboom krijgt en je toegang krijgt tot de force-commando's!\n"
"* Standaard\n"
"  * Algemene stamboom\n"
"* Gold\n"
"  * Serverspecifieke stamboom\n"
"  * Toegang tot de force-commando's ({forcedivorce_c}, {forcemarry_c}, "
"{forceadopt_c}, {forcerunaway_c})\n"
"  * Toegang tot {incest_c}\n"
"  * T3-voordelen voor al je serverleden\n"

#: misc.py:162
msgid "How to Support"
msgstr "Hoe kun je helpen?"

#: misc.py:164
msgid ""
"Subscriptions can be taken out on the [Voxel Fox website](https://voxelfox."
"co.uk/portal/marriagebot) :3"
msgstr ""
"Je kunt je abonneren via de [Voxel Fox-website](https://voxelfox.co.uk/"
