#. TRANSLATORS: Command name
#: settings.py:233
msgid "guild-settings guild-specific-families"
msgstr "gilde-instellingen gildespecifieke-families"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command description
#: settings.py:235
msgid "Set whether or not guild-specific families are enabled for this guild."
msgstr "Stel in of gildespecifieke families voor dit gilde zijn ingeschakeld."

#: settings.py:244
msgid ""
"This command cannot be run on the Gold version of MarriageBot. The regular "
"version of MarriageBot now allows you to toggle between guild-specific "
"families and global families.\n"
"\n"
"To use this command, please change over to the regular version of "
"MarriageBot and run this command."
msgstr ""
"Dit commando werkt niet in de Gold-versie van MarriageBot. In de "
"standaardversie van MarriageBot kun je nu schakelen tussen gildespecifieke "
"families en algemene families.\n"
"\n"
"Om dit commando te gebruiken, schakel je over naar de standaardversie van "
"MarriageBot en voer je dit commando uit."

#: settings.py:263
msgid ""
"You can only switch to guild-specific families (and thus use the `/force` "
"and `/incest` commands, enable polygamy for everyone in your server, and "
"increase your child count) after you have purchased MarriageBot Gold."
msgstr ""
"Je kunt pas overschakelen naar gildespecifieke families (en dus de "
"commando’s `/force` en `/incest` gebruiken, polygamie inschakelen voor "
"iedereen op je server en je aantal kinderen verhogen) nadat je MarriageBot "
"Gold hebt aangeschaft."

#: settings.py:295
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Guild-specific families are now **enabled** in this guild, and you can now "
"use the force commands.\n"
"Please note that this is a completely seperate tree than the global "
"MarriageBot tree.\n"
"\n"
"You can switch back to the global tree by using the {guild_specific_command} "
"command :3"
msgstr ""
"Gildespecifieke families zijn nu **ingeschakeld** in dit gilde, en je kunt "
"nu de force-commando’s gebruiken.\n"
"Let op: dit is een volledig aparte boomstructuur dan de algemene MarriageBot-"
"boomstructuur.\n"
"\n"
"Je kunt terugschakelen naar de algemene boomstructuur met het commando "
"{guild_specific_command} :3"

#: settings.py:304
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Guild-specific families are now **disabled** in this guild. You are now "
"switched back to the global MarriageBot tree.\n"
"\n"
"You can switch back to your guild-specific tree by using the "
"{guild_specific_command} command :3"
msgstr ""
"Gildespecifieke families zijn nu **uitgeschakeld** in dit gilde. Je bent nu "
"teruggeschakeld naar de algemene MarriageBot-stamboom.\n"
"\n"
"Je kunt terugschakelen naar je gildespecifieke stamboom door het commando "
"{guild_specific_command} te gebruiken :3"

